# handle-hover-shift (h7-plane): the pointer resting on the shift diamond
# (x2 at a=2, h=1, k=-3: diamond at plot (1,-3) = page (978,640)).
# h and k lit in the readout and the rows, both arrows, cursor grab-hover.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&a=2&h=1&k=-3
wait 500
move 978 640
wait 300
shot handle-hover-shift
